         ("faith","Church events|Easter service|Christmas service|Christmas Eve service|Church picnic|Church potluck|Church camp|Revival|Worship|Baptisms|Confirmations|Bar mitzvahs|Bat mitzvahs|First Holy Communion|Ordination|Pilgrimage|Hajj|Umrah|Temple visit|Gurdwara|Puja|Shabbat|Sabbath|Sunday service|Mass at the cathedral|Cathedrals|Chapels|Monasteries|Shrines|Religious art"),
